From 6f1251a64976a02680fdc7afc827f7c7f17980a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sn3ro <zak.darek@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:42:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] docs(decisions): correct two statements of the #2441
 entry

The #2441 entry says the v68 migration keeps the example projects
byte-identical, but PR #2504 rebuilt the catalog case 2d/first-part and
examples/first-router-part.camproj. It also says MCP and script patches
default to FullDiameter, but edit_operation merges a patch over the
stored parameters, so an omitted break_through_from keeps the stored
value. RECOMMENDED.md is not edited on an issue branch, so the
correction is recorded in this PR's own decision file.

Refs #2528

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
